<br/>
<br/>Engineers can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59359/reinforced-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> which is significantly stronger than the alternatives, due to its higher item level. It can be socketed with Engineering-only Cogwheel gems like <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59479/quick-cogwheel">
<img alt="Quick Cogwheel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick Cogwheel</span></a>, making it highly customizeable which is great for pre-raid gearing.<br/>
<br/>You may notice this set does not use the tier gear available from the Valor Points-vendor. This is not because the gear is bad. It is actually often better than the alternatives. However, you are unlikely to be able to acquire it before your first raid, as other pieces are much more important and you are limited by the amount of valor points you can obtain.<br/>
<br/>
<b>IMPORTANT:</b> The suggested items below are ranked with one option presented as the best, while others are simply "optional". Due to reforging, it is near impossible to rank several optional pieces. Simply put, what is best for you in a sub-optimal gear set might be worse for someone else, as reforging affects this massively. The embedded gear set above has reforges included, but they are seen in the context of you having every item available to you. If you are missing crucial pieces, you likely have to reforge your wait out of potential hit issues.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">
<span class="c6">Body Armor for Unholy Death Knight DPS</span></h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Head for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59359/reinforced-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> is definitely the choice for your helm for all Plate DPS. The superior item level, stat budget and customizability of this item puts it on a level that is clearly above all the other options because it has so much <i>more</i> stats than the alternatives.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62368/arcanum-of-the-dragonmaw">
