<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62345/greater-inscription-of-jagged-stone">
