<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Back for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>Things become a bit hairy here, as our best option is an expensive BoE-world drop. Its higher item level leads to a unrivaled stat budget, compared to the next-best option from Heroic Deadmines. There are numerous other strength-based cloaks with an item level of 343 that can fit into your gearset, depending on what you need in regards of stats. All of them are more or less equal when applying proper reforges.<br/>
<br/>
<b>BiS Cloak Enchant (Tailoring Only)</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75178/swordguard-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74247/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike</span></a>
