<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Hands for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>Another easy slot with many comparable options. However, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56336/hematite-plate-gloves">
<img alt="Hematite Plate Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hematite Plate Gloves</span></a> comes out as a slight winner over its competitors. Strength, Crit, Haste and a powerful red socket that grants us even more Haste. What's not to like here?<br/>Note: Synapse Springs now stack with regular enchants, so make sure to get both as an Engineer!<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant for Engineers</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74254/enchant-gloves-mighty-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Mighty Strength</span></a>
