<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Legs for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>Yet another expensive BoE, that might be extremely hard to obtain before your first raid. Either way, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67141/corefire-legplates">
<img alt="Corefire Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corefire Legplates</span></a> are just so much better than the alternatives, due to the higher item level and thus larger stat budget. If you are unable to obtain these, just grab the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58097/greaves-of-gallantry">
<img alt="Greaves of Gallantry" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_dungeonplate_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greaves of Gallantry</span></a> from the Justice Points-vendor, as these are the only other great option.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56550/dragonscale-leg-armor">
<img alt="Dragonscale Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterscales_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonscale Leg Armor</span></a>
