<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Feet for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>Things get a bit interesting here. Our best option comes from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. These boots are likely to be out of reach due to the cap on the amount of available VP before raids are available, as you typically would prefer purchasing other pieces first. However, since they are BoE, you can buy them from another player.<br/>
<br/>The second best option comes from Revered reputation with Guardians of Hyjal and are thus much easier to get.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74199/enchant-boots-haste">
