<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Rings for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>For our ring slots, we have a multitude of options, that can be mixed and matched depending on what stats we need, as well as our access to expensive BoEs and income of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>s. Note that you will likely not be able to get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58185/band-of-bees">
<img alt="Band of Bees" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Bees</span></a> before your first raid, as other pieces are more important. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74215/enchant-ring-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Strength</span></a> -  Only Enchanters may apply Ring Enchants on their own rings.<div class="pad"></div>
