<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Trinkets for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>Trinkets are a bit interesting, but fortunately relatively easy to acquire. Note that <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56393/heart-of-solace">
<img alt="Heart of Solace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_persecution.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Solace</span></a> is your phase 1 BiS item, so make sure you get it while farming dungeons. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58180/license-to-slay">
<img alt="License to Slay" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">License to Slay</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68712/impatience-of-youth">
<img alt="Impatience of Youth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_idol_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Impatience of Youth</span></a> are both replaced, but should still be obtained, as they are quite powerful when progressing Heroic difficulty. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68712/impatience-of-youth">
<img alt="Impatience of Youth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_idol_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Impatience of Youth</span></a> can be particularly powerful on very particular fights like Nefarian, where damage increasing modifiers can be stacked with the on-use effect to snapshot diseases.<div class="pad"></div>
