<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">
<span class="c6">Weapons for Unholy Death Knight DPS</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Weapons for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>Probably to no ones surprise - our best weapon before stepping into raids is the infamous <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64377/zinrokh-destroyer-of-worlds">
<img alt="Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_zinrokh-sword.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds</span></a> from Archeology. Hopefully you have farmed this during the prepatch, as it is so much better than the second best option. It is essentially 1:1 with the normal version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63679/reclaimed-ashkandi-greatsword-of-the-brotherhood">
<img alt="Reclaimed Ashkandi, Greatsword of the Brotherhood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_50.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reclaimed Ashkandi, Greatsword of the Brotherhood</span></a>, making it your best option until Heroic Raiding.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=53344/rune-of-the-fallen-crusader">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_retributionaura.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Fallen Crusader</span></a>
